  "title": "Sale-leasebacks: A Flexible Capital Solution Across the M&A Lifecycle",
  "summary": "As private equity firms continue to navigate a dynamic M&A environment, access to capital is critical. One increasingly important tool in their toolkit is the sale-leaseback. By unlocking capital embedded in real estate, sale-leasebacks can support transactions at multiple stages of the deal lifecycle – from acquisition financing to post-close optimization.",
